summary:
IT Support Technician / IT Service Desk Analyst / Service Desk Support / IT Support Analyst /1st/2nd Support / 1st & 2nd Line Support / IT Technician / IT Specialist / IT Support Engineer
Widen The Net is a partner recruitment agency to Snap and we are hiring for their contract positions.
On site based in Chandler office.
Snap are looking for an IT support technician to support their brand new IT labs based in Chandler, Arizona, manage vendor relationship and ensure IT services delivery:
-Troubleshooting for Mac OS and Windows Server, network, switches, AD, cloud backups, Google Workspace, JAMF, Atlassian, Slack, OTKA, Jira,
-Clearing tickets backlog, analysing issues and following up with end users, escalate technical issues, helping resolving problems and finding root cause within SLA;
-Building good relationship with 3rd party software/hardware vendors;
-Documentations
Requirements:
-2 + years experience working as IT support/service desk/IT technician;
-Strong working knowledge in Windows server;
-Knowledge in ticketing management system such as ServiceNow or Jira;
-Excellent client facing and problem solving skills, creative thinking and sociable personality;
-Experience supporting C-level executives is a big plus
Initially 11 months contract (full time Monday to Friday) till the end of 2024, very likely to renew afterwards. This contract is paying $34.79 per hour and will be through a W2 local employer. Onsite based in Chandler, Arizona.
